@startuml Sum_Ssfm_DTC_Error_Filter_Manager
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

legend top left
    "Sum_Ssfm_DTC_Error_Filter"
	
**Interfaces Legend**
	//II152 //: ERRH_ExecutionStatus
	//II180 //: Undebounced Error
	//II181 //: Debounced Error

endlegend

note top of EC
It is responsible for implementing the different types of filters that are used to filter the various errors processed by the SSFM-ERRH.
end note

component [SSFM::Sum_Ssfm_DTC_Error_Filter as EC{

	[Sum_Ssfm_DTC_Error_Filter]  as E
}
   
   II152 -> E
   II180 -> E
   E -> II181





@enduml
